{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"39526","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v45553","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[{"creditedName":"bermei.inazawa","creatorId":"vndb:s8896","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8896","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8896","name":"bermei.inazawa","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:197166","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"DOVA-SYNDROME","creatorId":"vndb:s10246","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10246","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10246","name":"DOVA-SYNDROME","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:197167","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"魔王魂","creatorId":"vndb:s12140","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12140","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12140","name":"魔王魂","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:197168","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Freesound.org","creatorId":"vndb:s23831","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23831","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23831","name":"The Free Sound Project","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:197169","source":"vndb"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"aon","creatorId":"vndb:s55140","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s55140","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s55140","name":"aon","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:197170","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127869","characterName":"Rose Fryberg","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127869"},"originalCharacterName":"Rose Fryberg","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"421"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An earnest girl born in Volcano Kingdom. Yearning to be like the legendary hero Lebsa, she knocks on the door of the prestigious St. Elmore Knight Academy in Volcano Kingdom. Her only family is her kindly father and a strange pet bird called Lily. With the help of her father, she makes her way through the world, working toward a knighthood while dealing with her unusual classmates."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from English Official site"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her name, birthdate, and blood type are all customizable."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127869"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/93f4d0b96fe3c5b9a28e413d8540788a5b7ed26a256968035c586fe3a9ab3112.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/ccf3c9703d4810a56a4cdac862578da887865815934e7f8fc7f644e54a2a827a.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中原 麻衣","creatorId":"vndb:s444","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s444","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s444","name":"中原 麻衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95387","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127870","characterName":"Wood Fryberg","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127870"},"originalCharacterName":"Wood Fryberg","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The player character."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A widowed father living in a corner of Volcano Kingdom, raising his only daughter alone after the passing of his wife, Luca. Once a knight of some renown, his only goal in life now is to see his daughter grow up strong and hale. While he dreams of a tranquil life where she's called \"a normal girl,\" his daughter has decided to take up a chivalric path. He watches over her while offering whatever support he can."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from English Official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127870"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fa6f630ac85ab2190703f42a42129a48d6b9e60179d0fe7b2f8db997df3b9383.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/91050230e0400d1fdbe36ed3c71fb8a483e156bff63ba0e395ce9bcecbc11e73.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林親弘","creatorId":"vndb:s20191","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s20191","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s20191","name":"小林親弘","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95398","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127876","characterName":"Kenneth Claremont","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127876"},"originalCharacterName":"Kenneth Claremont","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"401"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Prince of Volcano Kingdom and brother of Gwyneth. He was kidnapped when he was little and accidentally damaged his brain and speaking ability. As a result, he tends to stammer when speaking, but he has a kind heart."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has many scars on his body and wears turtlenecks daily to cover them. He was trained in the forest to fight, although the skill came to him naturally. Due to his time spent in the forest, he claims to have met the Owl Princess and gained an affinity for magical creatures."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Upon returning back to the Palace, he proactively takes a part in integrating with society once again."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127876"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/81/81f09efe4540349fea341c6c9d71ad7d290ea6f7838293eef80ad24623e1e53a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9f8017804ca95ff41fc0eb6e96166a998bbb011bb5ee9758aa82fb8ff5218539.webp","width":189,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大塚 竹男","creatorId":"vndb:s10019","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10019","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10019","name":"大塚 竹男","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95392","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127877","characterName":"Gwyneth Claremont","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127877"},"originalCharacterName":"Gwyneth Claremont","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"401"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"167"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Princess of Volcano Kingdom, but she hates to be addressed as such. She is working hard to become the heir and proactively participates in both politics and military affairs."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The only person she trusts around her is her brother. She doesn't expect him to ever be completely normal again but still hopes he has a safe life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She rarely has time for fun; when she isn't studying she's accomplishing missions. She hopes she can find a way to lead the Kingdom into a better future through history and hopes Rose can be part of her journey."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127877"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8ad5cc8da21dbc2c9794e61e3e9aaf245eb24476c9cca949b23bcb82ce1a544f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/35c35bd380dfce78a9ad2c0438bddf17d9ade84cc2f726c383abd5bea0eb1ad5.webp","width":189,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"石川 由依","creatorId":"vndb:s7547","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7547","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7547","name":"石川 由依","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95391","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127878","characterName":"Hackett Munster","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127878"},"originalCharacterName":"Hackett Munster","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1201"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A knight in Volcano Kingdom who possesses outstanding skills. He grew up on the lakeside of Wild Horse Lake and helped with farm work every and then. He always has a bountiful harvest because of his love for nature and animals."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He used to be an orphan who lived among other refugees, who all helped raise him. He was later adopted by the same woman who adopted Benson."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He likes to go into the forest because it seems he has something big planned. He has an extreme distaste for pocahers."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127878"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/44b7ba95a73feb5e978dd689851dd8c5c66738c175abe8efdadfb9fe310227f4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7a670bfd4178c6b56aaba9bb118d87458c4af606aa3d0cebb83f0f8d64e4e336.webp","width":177,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小松 昌平","creatorId":"vndb:s16212","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s16212","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s16212","name":"猿飛総司","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95396","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127903","characterName":"Ze Lake","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127903"},"originalCharacterName":"Ze Lake","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"101"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A bounty hunter who travels the world. He is exceptionally proficient with bows and enjoys practicing with them in his spare time. He is particularly fixed on becoming stronger."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He doesn't like to talk about himself and often goes into the Forgotten Forest to hunt. He comes from the ancient battle family Rick. His father's death rankles in his mind, and he was even the boss of the Back Street for a short time because of it- of course, he sees this a dark history and doesn't talk about it at all. He prefers to speak to animals more than humans and owns a horse named Raven."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His father used to say to him: \"I will only pass my bow to the one who can shoot down St. Elmo's fire.\" This sentence resonates in his head, and he hopes one day he will be able to find out the truth behind his father's death and seek revenge."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127903"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5d9410e0bc5b594870ba97be2d32464284e9710ea73fef2e026bb3cc417ea975.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/28/284449f1e6107ac937baf5d9e692880414110afe9da2773cbdac8053013c116a.webp","width":200,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"笠間 淳","creatorId":"vndb:s19109","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s19109","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19109","name":"笠間 淳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95397","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127905","characterName":"Lon Hill","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127905"},"originalCharacterName":"Lon Hill","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"601"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The genius scholar at St. Elmo's academy. He was born into the ancient knight family, the Hills. His family recommended he participate in research for magical creatures since he was young. His father is the head knight; he loves hearing his parents talk about the stories they heard. He is childhood friends with Craig."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He accidentally stumbled into the land of magical creatures when he was a kid and witnessed an extraordinary scene, which infused his curiosity for magical creatures."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He likes to write scripts in his spare time and hopes one day he will be able to write a story demonstrating the truth of this world."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127905"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e95ffe13afda01b385a9c35d4d8cd9262a34bd21fb7001592cda0084b52858a0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/0692c2da38d44c81dabeb60a3d544228f65e15669a456e8867f23b7b53e0cb1e.webp","width":173,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"阿部 敦","creatorId":"vndb:s633","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s633","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s633","name":"阿部 敦","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95388","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127906","characterName":"Craig Wheel","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127906"},"originalCharacterName":"Craig Wheel","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"201"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He was born into the famous music family of Wheel and brought up to be a pianist, making him exceptionally talented. He is childhood friends with Lon."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Always practices the piano until late, so he is always sleepy during the day. He majors in music at school and hates mathematics."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His father expects them to enroll at the top music academy, Moriland, but this is something painful for him. Everyone in the family performs outstandingly, and that's why Craig always feels a lot of pressure. He hopes one day he can stand on stage without fear."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127906"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c1/c1092919a7b5b065c86e33d7f8aae66020fdd8d9bf4bc4f3b01bf6d4260c5fbb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dcc3c0f87303dfd75592344810be80f4e1188cae73e7fb54ce85221960486c74.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"伊東 健人","creatorId":"vndb:s13539","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s13539","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s13539","name":"伊東 健人","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95395","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127932","characterName":"Mona Albrecht","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127932"},"originalCharacterName":"Mona Albrecht","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"801"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"171"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The owner of a family restaurant who loves cooking and socializing and has a keen heart to succeed. She has known Nina since she was a kid and sees her as a little sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She likes to stay close yet distant with everyone. She seems to have a complicated history with the Handels. Her mother passed away a long time ago."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has witnessed Nina growing up but seems to have a love-hate relationship seeing Nina living a carefree life. She doesn't want Nina to find out about her dark side, so she wants to protect Nina's innocence."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127932"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/04934d3e8da7e488e990aa6ef3404fd830ee167614848cbc061958e0016c9534.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d476baadd64206737594ae3f2c7471e6cde0f67f7dd46e85ee4eea5e33560fc8.webp","width":173,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"井上 麻里奈","creatorId":"vndb:s1774","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1774","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1774","name":"井上 麻里奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95390","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127933","characterName":"Nina Handel","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127933"},"originalCharacterName":"Nina Handel","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"301"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The fourth daughter of the Handels who majors in theology at school. She spends most of her time studying with the archbishop at the altar and even occasionally works as a priest."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is not as popular as her brothers and sisters and hates the lying atmosphere back at home. However, she's pretty outgoing in front of Mona and Rose and relies on Mona quite a lot."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nina's father passed away when she was still young. Although her mother is quite strict with her, she still has a lot of respect for her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127933"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d5/d5d7523d59bf522b66d0fec94dac1fcd8025ec61fa147e35c6722c1a914f216b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b0/b0c88ed9aec820cb84c18dc57346d100986fd837e33ef3be8a33838dcbdf03a4.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高田 憂希","creatorId":"vndb:s10197","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10197","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10197","name":"高田 憂希","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95393","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127934","characterName":"Benson Muller","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127934"},"originalCharacterName":"Benson Muller","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"701"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The royal painter of Volcano Kingdom. Him demonstrating his outstanding ability in painting has led them to become an apprentice of a royal painter at a young age. He earns a living through making commercial paintings in his spare time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As a former refugee of the Heathrott War, he has witnessed horrible things that make him hate war. He often prays for peace to continue."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is tired of commercial paintings and hopes to have enough money saved one day to travel everywhere and paint about the things he is interested in."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127934"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/dfbe1c91c720625affaa1dbeced037144e889859062b0f9c7e85ac2b70d8b12d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/3207545c5b5ff0fb81fce6a33d40b7ea9f46403110568a8cad3c3dee2538d158.webp","width":207,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"寺島 惇太","creatorId":"vndb:s11126","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11126","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11126","name":"寺島 惇太","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95394","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127935","characterName":"Lebsa Lorace","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127935"},"originalCharacterName":"Lebsa Lorace","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"170"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lebsa was adopted by the Handels when she became an adult and became a Lord due to her excellent battle ability and reputation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her battle ability is truly astounding; according to her, she is the disciple of Hero Asbell."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her looks and status allowed her to be popular among teenagers. But underneath all that, she has occasional outbursts of emotional instability and seems like she has an unknown past..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127935"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5d6f1c5334758b4afa40e53c891701749cd484122a665287b95d2154631302e9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c3/c3c331dacf64f94c12213a7218a5685b5672554643c593f8bfd2353c44620928.webp","width":194,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"皆川 純子","creatorId":"vndb:s948","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s948","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s948","name":"皆川純子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95389","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127936","characterName":"Claude Bryan","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127936"},"originalCharacterName":"Claude Bryan","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1001"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"183"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Principal of St. Elmo's and the youngest principal in history. One of the three Lords of Volcano Kingdom, but has personally expressed greater interest in research."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He wasn't the brightest as a child but demonstrated amazing ability when he entered the research institute and published many vital papers on magical creatures with his team."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is always kind to his students and no one has ever seen him angry."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127936"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9b43c2a4a224f21175390bb0d3c69905a2630d19551e811e65bc4eaf0b1cc5a8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/10d718d789d119756561b5564fb4a28f7c26639c3bbd179832c07ca3aaa3d18f.webp","width":222,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127937","characterName":"Basilou","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127937"},"originalCharacterName":"Basilou","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1218"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"178"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"When he was younger he lived in the nearby village and moved to Wild Horse Lake because his parents operate a mill."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He used to admire a girl and had always watched her from afar, but gradually lost interest in love as he grew older."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127937"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c1a2307fcb18d441a10ac7ffdcedb51da02891ca6257f43e4c77d799e2a005c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c94cb8f6f0d1477d9c19f58dd3dee4b90b030a0a5b9680c58ea9128237d957b2.webp","width":256,"height":252,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127938","characterName":"Luca Fryberg","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127938"},"originalCharacterName":"Luca Fryberg","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The player's wife and Rose's mother. She passed away prior to the story's start."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127938"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e73a9acb2541a5527d6b07550212300e1ee8eb48d18a6c690ab8adceb099dc37.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3ded6b5160fb76c76e99a524d9dd493a779abbd15f24177ec5e28a35525cc7fc.webp","width":256,"height":144,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127939","characterName":"Derrick Schofield","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127939"},"originalCharacterName":"Derrick Schofield","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"526"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"178"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Wandered from the Harris Kingdom, he now makes a living out of telling stories in Handel's Restaurant. He loves to listen to all kinds of stories and buys Stories from others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He eloped with a girl when he was young and snuck into Volcano Kingdom to settle here. However, they broke up because Derrick is more used to a nomadic life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After Derrick settled down, he learnt to make a living by telling stories, but he never met another girl who understood him better than she did."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127939"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8f/8fb51b67b15182146184a7ac73aedb2f9713327d35b7314a2ab39737c2cd2d8c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c3/c38dcb1defba019a89184213ddb5bdc6bc3f16509c8a23622289075828ce51a6.webp","width":256,"height":252,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127976","characterName":"Rebecca Ira","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127976"},"originalCharacterName":"Rebecca Ira","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"308"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She migrated from the Diamond Kingdom and now runs a clothing store in Central Plaza. She has a strong passion for designing and making clothes and would often head to the farm to pick the materials herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She used to be an opera singer and still sometimes sings in front of her shop. She fell in love with a soldier in the Volcano Kingdom and they settled there together, but he never returned after heading to the forest."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127976"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/31/31cf869053c942b6577de92c3149e335bf5c35b96814c1f841ad9e9b30f96acb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a7566df9260a66948d277fd45514d899221b3f95cc1707289755d83ee2b5c037.webp","width":256,"height":252,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127977","characterName":"Jermaine Tholson","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127977"},"originalCharacterName":"Jermaine Tholson","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"626"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"184"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He started learning about weapon crafting with his father when he was young. He is hardworking and knows how to care for others around him. Following his father's passing, he took over his business. Although he still misses him, he and his mother now rely on one another."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Jermaine kept in mind that his father always said he wanted to go to the seaside back home after retiring, so he wants to take his mother back home once he finds a successor for the weapon shop."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127977"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/30/30accd40b01b1b6f247e1b70b4b6b205ab00167413902a9a6d4011df1e2d37c6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/91e533ebcb85b0162cb9647f182004462907c8549b0b6dd03ac7c6a85627ee46.webp","width":256,"height":252,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127978","characterName":"Mary Rogen","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127978"},"originalCharacterName":"Mary Rogen","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"501"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The owner of the Bath. She grew up in the central district and loved to stroll around different towns when she became an adult."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a distant relative of Benson and has had a talent for painting since birth. Her painting was on the same level as the royal painters when she was 16. She worked as a royal painter for a few years, then lost all her creativity and resigned with sickness as an excuse. Nowadays, she likes to date different people in her spare time and hopes one day she can find a love that will reactivate her passion for life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127978"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/68cb70757906af89a0782de64e5ec224ca18f7bc22c73b1d30fa5c1f51e4dd4f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4c/4ca95f868b60dcd212031420333c146a2592fec9a4c08570f57cbfd54c0b5938.webp","width":256,"height":252,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127979","characterName":"Connie Facio","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127979"},"originalCharacterName":"Connie Facio","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"409"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She strongly believes in theology and respects Pontiff Claire's wisdom; she often asks him questions about theology. She loves children and is saving money to build an orphanage one day."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was born into a wealthy family in the central district but had witnessed many poor men suffer. Becoming a nun was her way of escaping an arranged marriage."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127979"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b7638a96289ac6c0bec00a7584c5e3a5995cc3f94c7075920651b6f86f05d78d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/ab7683165a182c90aa9cd7745339354e01a560c3d49fccb4d172c75b8fff93a8.webp","width":256,"height":252,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c127980","characterName":"Mark Barry","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c127980"},"originalCharacterName":"Mark Barry","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1101"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"176"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He constantly boasts about having an older brother who became a knight, but no one has ever met them. He is responsible for the morning duties and has a general passion for his job. He is always working hard when chief is here and hopes he will become a knight one day. At the same time, he is saving up for the expensive armor and war horse."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He creates poems in this spare time and often sings them to strangers, especially ladies walking past. A few hearts fell for him, but he never noticed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from in-game bio"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127980"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c6becd573e5fc31d50c0c85833d0e71b09b61ea46c9178b1dbe299ca3827f99.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e802426e4561245257702606e26e150e96ac74aa3c6be5e99fe3ddb98c837720.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p18912","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:9245","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p18912","name":"Egg Hatcher","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:39526:9245","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p7489","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p7489","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p7489","name":"Gamera Games","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:120047:v45553","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p18912","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p18912","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p18912","name":"养蛋人工作室","roleCodes":["developer"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:120048:v45553","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p19599","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p19599","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p19599","name":"Вит747","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:122459:v45553","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p11025","sourceCom